(text "Firmware: device-only mode, PA11/PA12 AF10, PA9 GPIO low=VBUS present; native VBUS detect disabled.\nNo external D+ pullup or series termination is fitted: STM32F767 FS PHY includes the required functions.\nHost VBUS feeds ESD reference and MOSFET gate ONLY; it must never be merged with +5V_CORE.\nUSB 48MHz clock, descriptors, attach/detach with ECU off, EMC and connector sealing remain unqualified." (at 25.4 315 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fe2b0096-ed23-5daf-ad4b-7a41f46005bf"))
